00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:36.200
Oh, if you think that's what you wish.

00:45:36.740 --> 00:45:37.800
Are you going or not?

00:45:38.220 --> 00:45:39.540
Shut up, Miss Moravich.

00:45:40.100 --> 00:45:43.500
To him, I think you're so sad.

00:45:44.210 --> 00:45:45.570
You will not have me do this thing.

00:45:46.130 --> 00:45:48.430
I'll go down on my knees to you if you wish.

00:45:51.330 --> 00:45:52.610
Sometimes in your life,

00:45:52.980 --> 00:45:56.040
you will want something as badly as I do now.

00:45:56.820 --> 00:45:58.660
Well, are you going with the senor or not?

00:46:00.600 --> 00:46:01.580
The minutes are ticking away.

00:46:02.450 --> 00:46:05.290
I am to go with Senor Bastard.

00:46:06.520 --> 00:46:08.140
He's opening that door right now.

00:46:10.710 --> 00:46:12.170
There goes the change of guard now.

00:46:14.740 --> 00:46:16.120
One of my men will tip him off

00:46:16.120 --> 00:46:18.320
just as soon as Johnny Powell makes a dash for the horses.

00:46:25.810 --> 00:46:27.710
If you're quiet, you can hear the shots from up here.

00:46:27.850 --> 00:46:29.440
Oh, here at the start.

00:46:30.320 --> 00:46:38.020
I'll go with you. Tell the chief of police what you know to be the truth.

00:46:39.190 --> 00:46:40.450
What is the truth?

00:46:41.150 --> 00:46:45.580
That Jody Powell was not out to kill O'Grady, but O'Grady was out to kill him.

00:46:46.240 --> 00:46:48.370
And then maybe they would set him free.

00:46:49.140 --> 00:46:57.940
Take him across the line. I know you keep your promise.

00:46:58.520 --> 00:46:58.940
You are.

00:47:15.190 --> 00:47:22.170
I will bring them the jail. Bring him here and I will talk for the last time.

00:47:22.290 --> 00:47:24.930
Do you think you can go through with it?

00:47:26.370 --> 00:47:29.720
I can do this thing because I am doing it to save his life.

00:47:30.380 --> 00:47:32.740
She will not break the word, because she knows it's the best thing.

00:47:33.700 --> 00:47:35.700
The promise is good, chiquita.

00:47:36.720 --> 00:47:38.730
I will do what I have to say.

00:47:41.650 --> 00:47:46.170
No one ever lose with a friend of Jose Maria López y Tostado.

00:47:46.620 --> 00:47:49.280
Come one of each. We're going to see the chiefs of the policía.

00:48:09.740 --> 00:48:12.850
They're going to take him across the border tonight.

00:48:14.860 --> 00:48:16.680
He'll go hard with him if he tries to come back.

00:48:19.060 --> 00:48:19.900
You get this.

00:48:20.960 --> 00:48:23.640
If you tip that kid off to anything except to tell him to blow,

00:48:24.160 --> 00:48:25.540
he won't be taken back to jail.

00:48:26.110 --> 00:48:29.270
He'll be found outside that wall there with a hole in his head.

00:48:30.570 --> 00:48:31.450
Uh, you go, A.D.

00:48:32.210 --> 00:48:32.530
Hello!

00:48:34.500 --> 00:48:35.180
Hey, Louie!

00:48:35.640 --> 00:48:36.580
Get that music going!

00:48:38.980 --> 00:48:41.430
Hi, Johnny.

00:48:42.530 --> 00:48:43.090
Good morning!

00:48:45.580 --> 00:48:46.020
Kid?

00:49:00.060 --> 00:49:00.660
What's the idea?

00:49:01.920 --> 00:49:04.450
The idea is to have the talk.

00:49:05.620 --> 00:49:09.120
Yeah? I don't get this, kid.

00:49:10.000 --> 00:49:13.610
Well, I have asked to see you, tell you.

00:49:14.060 --> 00:49:15.780
Tell me. Tell me what?

00:49:17.100 --> 00:49:18.300
Come on, kid, what's the straw?

00:49:20.250 --> 00:49:21.970
You guys have to listen to all this.

00:49:22.270 --> 00:49:23.390
Can't you wait outside the gate?

00:49:23.910 --> 00:49:26.700
You can understand if you want it.

00:49:27.620 --> 00:49:29.960
Johnny, I think it's better.

00:49:30.600 --> 00:49:34.450
Or both of us, you go with the soldiers across the line.

00:49:35.160 --> 00:49:37.410
And we see each other no more.

00:49:37.530 --> 00:49:41.060
What are you doing, stringing me?

00:49:43.030 --> 00:49:44.470
Who else is listening to this?

00:49:44.760 --> 00:49:48.440
No one. Everything was all right until you killed this man.

00:49:48.910 --> 00:49:51.480
But now, I think it is better we forget

00:49:51.480 --> 00:49:54.370
what you call our little foolishness,

00:49:55.330 --> 00:49:58.620
that you go back to your country and I stay here.

00:50:00.890 --> 00:50:02.890
So you haven't let these guys talk to you, have you?

00:50:03.490 --> 00:50:05.090
They haven't got a chance to frame me.

00:50:05.190 --> 00:50:07.010
It was self-defense, they have to recognize that.

00:50:08.420 --> 00:50:08.840
You're lying.

00:50:12.360 --> 00:50:15.520
I tell you, it's the best thing for both of us

00:50:16.920 --> 00:50:19.240
that we see each other no more.

00:50:22.010 --> 00:50:23.630
So you're calling this all off, huh?

00:50:25.600 --> 00:50:25.980
For good?

00:50:30.890 --> 00:50:37.120
When I told you that I love you, then I think I mean it.

00:50:38.020 --> 00:50:40.450
But what good do you do me now, Johnny Powell?

00:50:41.960 --> 00:50:43.780
The starter's got something to do with this.

00:50:44.840 --> 00:50:47.160
Sostado? What's he got to do with me?

00:50:47.940 --> 00:50:49.920
Think a girl cannot change her mind?

00:50:50.260 --> 00:50:51.680
Or is there some other man?

00:50:52.520 --> 00:50:54.000
I do this myself.

00:50:54.750 --> 00:50:55.950
Oh, no, Johnny Powell.

00:50:56.470 --> 00:50:57.950
I shall be the free one.

00:50:58.370 --> 00:50:59.370
Do as I please.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:03.860
When I'm ready, I'll go with one of my own countrymen.

00:51:04.410 --> 00:51:05.870
No American for me.

00:51:06.560 --> 00:51:09.680
Oh, no, and now I wish you to go.

00:51:10.180 --> 00:51:14.840
It's not nice for me to tell you so much that I am finished.

00:51:15.720 --> 00:51:16.620
You're all alike.

00:51:17.060 --> 00:51:18.660
Bill told me I was a kid with women.

00:51:18.780 --> 00:51:21.150
What are you doing with this?

00:51:30.120 --> 00:51:34.760
All right, I guess I know how to take a lickin'.

00:51:36.320 --> 00:51:37.380
I'll say goodbye then.

00:51:40.000 --> 00:51:42.510
If you don't mind, I'd like to keep this with me.

00:51:43.220 --> 00:51:50.260
All right, amigas, we'll take that right across the border.

00:51:51.690 --> 00:51:53.390
I thought you'd understand that.

00:51:55.940 --> 00:51:59.020
Come on, shake hands.

00:52:00.160 --> 00:52:04.430
Well, it never did any harm for pals to shake on the getaway.

00:52:09.170 --> 00:52:09.670
Good luck.

00:52:13.280 --> 00:52:14.920
You guys, I'll give you the right ear watch.

00:52:15.040 --> 00:52:16.400
The other one, the other one!

00:52:17.650 --> 00:52:27.880
The other one!

00:52:27.880 --> 00:52:27.960
The other one!

00:52:28.660 --> 00:52:29.800
You have to kill the war!

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:37.210
And so good you do it, I will leave it myself.

00:52:55.790 --> 00:52:56.730
Thanks, Daddy, dear.

00:52:58.180 --> 00:52:59.260
When I know he is safe,

00:53:00.160 --> 00:53:00.980
I will take it.

00:53:02.190 --> 00:53:02.950
Oh, I'm glad.

00:53:05.010 --> 00:53:05.730
Yes, I am.

00:53:06.770 --> 00:53:07.510
I'm glad.

00:53:08.970 --> 00:53:10.770
Why do you not cry?

00:53:11.770 --> 00:53:14.710
This thing of love makes everything different.

00:53:16.760 --> 00:53:17.860
I'll take this thing,

00:53:18.660 --> 00:53:21.780
and you'll be very glad to know you have helped make it quick.

00:53:23.190 --> 00:53:24.250
You're again, Kim.

00:53:30.640 --> 00:53:32.660
And when I get to my hacienda...

00:53:37.350 --> 00:53:42.680
He's gone, and I am very happy.

00:53:43.940 --> 00:53:48.900
Are we ready now, you and me, who know so much about the love?

00:53:49.390 --> 00:53:50.290
Come, sweet one.

00:53:51.120 --> 00:53:54.200
We will ride in the moonlight, and I will make you forget.

00:53:55.070 --> 00:53:55.890
Sure you will.

00:53:56.580 --> 00:53:59.980
We will go as far as Santa Lucia, and rest until the breakfast...

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:04.040
and tomorrow night we will be in my hacienda.

00:54:04.780 --> 00:54:06.420
And everyone is satisfied.

00:54:07.240 --> 00:54:10.160
See, Mark Moravich, how glad he looks.

00:54:10.880 --> 00:54:13.190
Everything comes out the way he wants.

00:54:15.750 --> 00:54:18.670
Señor Tostado, let's leave this place

00:54:18.670 --> 00:54:20.950
and go to our own hacienda,

00:54:21.580 --> 00:54:23.200
where we shall see it in the moonlight.

00:54:27.100 --> 00:54:29.460
He will tell me the things of love.

00:54:30.060 --> 00:54:38.440
You know so well. I think it's the best way.

00:54:44.640 --> 00:54:47.360
I am the best govallero in all in Mexico.

00:54:52.820 --> 00:54:53.280
Good night.

00:55:10.530 --> 00:55:14.190
Ah, buenos dias.

00:55:14.500 --> 00:55:14.640
Buenos dias.

00:55:14.640 --> 00:55:14.900
Buenos dias.

00:55:15.120 --> 00:55:16.140
The breakfast is today.

00:55:16.420 --> 00:55:18.100
And the señorita, she is awake?

00:55:18.260 --> 00:55:18.900
Oh, si, si.

00:55:19.140 --> 00:55:20.200
Ah, she's gone.

00:55:20.380 --> 00:55:22.700
Buenos dias, encanto.

00:55:23.880 --> 00:55:24.500
You look tired.

00:55:25.130 --> 00:55:25.790
Don't you never mind?

00:55:26.180 --> 00:55:29.970
Before the sun, she thinks you will be in my hacienda with many...

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:33.590
But I do not like the look on your face.

00:55:34.860 --> 00:55:36.350
Here, the chocolate is ready.

00:55:38.260 --> 00:55:40.020
Soon you will feel better, eh?

00:55:40.940 --> 00:55:42.850
It doesn't worry. I feel very good.

00:55:43.610 --> 00:55:45.380
Listen, Jamaica, I like you.

00:55:46.290 --> 00:55:47.650
Maybe soon I will love you.

00:55:48.370 --> 00:55:50.770
Then who knows, maybe I will keep you for myself.

00:55:51.430 --> 00:55:53.390
What do you say? How do you like that?

00:56:05.660 --> 00:56:06.100
Good morning.

00:56:06.280 --> 00:56:06.780
Good morning.

00:56:07.120 --> 00:56:09.830
Mr. Pavel is safe.

00:56:10.280 --> 00:56:10.960
Is it all the border?

00:56:11.280 --> 00:56:11.940
Yes, ma'am.

00:56:12.620 --> 00:56:13.600
We're coming with hunger, sir.

00:56:14.240 --> 00:56:14.840
We're going to go to lunch.

00:56:15.900 --> 00:56:16.220
All right.

00:56:16.570 --> 00:56:17.050
With your permission.

00:56:21.310 --> 00:56:23.070
You are sure he'll tell me no lie?

00:56:23.630 --> 00:56:28.020
If Mr. Pavel is safe, across the line, no more trouble for him.

00:56:28.500 --> 00:56:29.200
No more trouble.

00:56:29.740 --> 00:56:29.980
No more trouble.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:31.740
We will make no more talk about Senor Johnny Power.

00:56:37.660 --> 00:56:38.440
What's the matter? What do you think?

00:56:41.420 --> 00:56:44.310
Because he's Johnny Power for the last time.

00:56:45.510 --> 00:56:49.480
Now I know he stays very far away.

00:57:01.400 --> 00:57:03.940
I want very much to see your beautiful tarsus.

00:57:04.520 --> 00:57:06.040
You give the order, we start now.

00:57:06.420 --> 00:57:07.120
Si, senorita.

00:57:09.050 --> 00:57:11.110
I'm going on a long journey, senor,

00:57:12.270 --> 00:57:14.850
and I am going to be very happy.

00:57:30.160 --> 00:57:34.620
What did you say about the car?

00:57:34.820 --> 00:57:35.360
Very good.

00:58:25.490 --> 00:58:29.790
Where the heart is not, the body is no good.

00:58:30.760 --> 00:58:31.300
Give me the rest.

00:58:31.600 --> 00:58:32.520
I have no more.

00:58:32.860 --> 00:58:33.560
We shall say it.

00:58:33.680 --> 00:58:34.640
I have no more.

00:58:36.550 --> 00:58:36.750
Ah.

00:58:37.880 --> 00:58:39.340
Now I understand.

00:58:41.520 --> 00:58:43.810
I'm going on a long journey.

00:58:45.460 --> 00:58:48.740
I am going to be very happy.

00:58:51.640 --> 00:58:55.240
For you would go to my castle,

00:58:55.990 --> 00:58:57.970
which have cost 300,000 pesos.

00:58:59.260 --> 00:58:59.980
The lady of my...

00:59:00.440 --> 00:59:04.600
You would do this, you would take the life.

00:59:05.650 --> 00:59:06.630
Never in the life.

00:59:06.810 --> 00:59:09.610
Don Jose, Maria, Lopez and Tostado have a doing so.

00:59:10.530 --> 00:59:11.790
What I care for you guys.

00:59:12.850 --> 00:59:15.220
I know that you are a very bad thing to do.

00:59:15.870 --> 00:59:20.720
Make the life what I have saved by Johnny Powell.

00:59:21.830 --> 00:59:23.510
Oh, what is the body?

00:59:23.970 --> 00:59:25.650
When the heart is gone.

00:59:26.300 --> 00:59:27.400
What I care about the heart.

00:59:27.940 --> 00:59:29.460
You can't want anything like this.

00:59:30.540 --> 00:59:39.270
Well, I tell you, these hands around my neck are just as soft and warm, no matter what is the heart.

00:59:41.590 --> 00:59:42.070
Smile.

00:59:42.890 --> 00:59:43.750
I like that.

00:59:44.130 --> 00:59:45.780
Let me tell you something.

00:59:46.440 --> 00:59:47.940
The life of myself is mine.

00:59:48.330 --> 00:59:52.700
This you cannot have, so sure that you touch me, make me yours.

00:59:53.170 --> 00:59:54.750
Then I want no more to live.

00:59:55.460 --> 00:59:58.000
If you want something like this, go ahead.

00:59:58.620 --> 00:59:59.980
But every time I look at...

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:00.220
Thank you.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:36.100
First move you make that call anyone. It's all up with you. See come on kid. We'll use the senior's car. It's all right

01:00:36.320 --> 01:00:40.400
What you will steal my car? No, just kind of borrow

01:00:44.940 --> 01:00:59.710
I guess that last night when you were making your big stall in the garden wasn't sure till I saw that big spider more of it in the window

01:01:00.160 --> 01:01:01.080
And I knew what you'd done.

01:01:01.750 --> 01:01:03.770
So I rode across the line and turned and beat it back.

01:01:04.260 --> 01:01:06.700
Your trail was easy to follow with this big satch car.

01:01:07.250 --> 01:01:10.010
So you'll come all the way down here and make it a big bluff, eh?

01:01:10.870 --> 01:01:12.350
You stick the pistol in my stomach.

01:01:13.420 --> 01:01:13.760
All right.

01:01:15.720 --> 01:01:18.000
Either way and see how far you'll get.

01:01:18.840 --> 01:01:19.960
We're going to try anyway.

01:01:31.850 --> 01:01:35.200
Only, I ask you, please, don't tell nobody.

01:01:36.200 --> 01:01:38.500
I would not want to be called Senor Sepp de Boog.

01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:40.920
Once we're out of here, you'll never hear of us again.

01:01:41.300 --> 01:01:42.920
Gracias, mil gracias.

01:01:43.120 --> 01:01:45.500
And now, we drink to the test.

01:02:01.050 --> 01:02:04.940
So little dog, Johnny Powell didn't want to get shot in Mexicana,

01:02:05.140 --> 01:02:06.580
so he came all the way down here.

01:02:07.420 --> 01:02:08.300
That's a good joke.

01:02:18.540 --> 01:02:20.510
What kind of fool do you think he is?

01:02:21.040 --> 01:02:22.480
The trial is over, my friend.

01:02:30.670 --> 01:02:35.600
I want to prove to you that American is a coward, like all gringos.

01:02:35.990 --> 01:02:36.850
He's going to be afraid.

01:02:37.050 --> 01:02:38.900
Yes, it will be a very good lesson for him.

01:02:39.130 --> 01:02:41.790
And so, in the future, he won't be afraid of the Mexican police.

01:02:43.450 --> 01:02:43.790
Attention!

01:02:48.430 --> 01:02:49.390
Can I not, little dog?

01:02:49.920 --> 01:02:51.240
Oh, can I not, little dog?

01:02:51.460 --> 01:02:54.510
The escaped prisoner in Mexico, that is the law.

01:02:55.890 --> 01:02:59.960
I've only come to help in a hard place, let me...

01:03:06.470 --> 01:03:12.610
I won't take the life, but I care for you, Palabra.

01:03:13.120 --> 01:03:15.320
If I give him his life, I will be Senor Sap the book.

01:03:15.710 --> 01:03:18.470
No, no, the Senor Jerry Paul is too quick with a pistola.

01:03:22.370 --> 01:03:25.750
Put him down against the wall, with the blood he will show.

01:03:27.040 --> 01:03:29.970
And in a long, long time to come, those who look...

01:03:30.730 --> 01:03:34.500
We'll see what it's not good to do to Don Jose and Maria Lottes.

01:03:37.060 --> 01:03:37.980
Mother, wait!

01:03:38.890 --> 01:03:41.150
Don't break anymore, kid. Let's show them.

01:03:42.070 --> 01:03:42.310
Attention!

01:03:43.940 --> 01:03:48.720
No, please! I'll go with you there.

01:03:49.760 --> 01:03:54.480
Body away. Body, do you wish for them to see?

01:03:54.700 --> 01:03:55.830
No, kid. No.

01:03:57.510 --> 01:03:59.300
This body doesn't make you pig.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:02.970
And when it's done, all I ask you should do.

01:04:03.440 --> 01:04:05.900
Come on, Bustada, be a good sport, get it over with.

01:04:06.210 --> 01:04:07.490
Be game, I tell you, be game.

01:04:07.950 --> 01:04:09.970
And as you look towards the sun for the last time,

01:04:10.970 --> 01:04:12.530
you will remember what I have told you.

01:04:13.470 --> 01:04:15.530
And it is not good to try to make the fool.

01:04:16.040 --> 01:04:19.240
Odo José, María, López y Tostado, D.B.

01:04:24.620 --> 01:04:29.970
All men, all men...

01:04:30.120 --> 01:04:38.620
I know that you are not the best caballero, but the big bluff, the big foreflush, the yellow coward who shoot the young Americano.

01:04:39.250 --> 01:04:48.890
When I first come to Mexicana, everyone has to say, did you not meet the grand caballero, Señor Tostado, the greatest one in Mexico?

01:04:49.300 --> 01:04:54.660
And I have seen him, how he walks, how he talks, how his sombrero comes off.

01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:59.280
And I think, too, he's the best caballero, for it comes the time.

01:05:02.360 --> 01:05:12.480
We have the coward, who's the fate of one little man, last, last.

01:05:12.680 --> 01:05:23.610
The name of Don Jose Marea Lopez y Tostado.

01:05:24.230 --> 01:05:27.540
And remember this for the last time.

01:05:27.800 --> 01:05:29.960
You, the grand senor, you shall have...

01:05:30.060 --> 01:05:32.200
Learn today what Gran Caballero means.

01:05:32.770 --> 01:05:35.150
If you are such Gran Caballero as he is,

01:05:35.770 --> 01:05:37.370
why don't you give him the chance?

01:05:38.230 --> 01:05:40.960
You take the pistola, he takes the pistola,

01:05:41.080 --> 01:05:43.600
and we'll be the best Caballero.

01:05:45.360 --> 01:05:48.760
I think that's...

01:05:48.760 --> 01:05:53.020
No one is greater Caballero,

01:05:53.180 --> 01:05:55.880
no one will say Maria Lopez and Tostado, that's me.

01:05:56.650 --> 01:05:58.290
No one will believe you.

01:06:00.030 --> 01:06:10.180
Then I can see him die, but all my life I can say the best caballero in all of Mexico was...

01:06:12.120 --> 01:06:17.350
My wish, that we shall know who is the best caballero in all of Mexico.

01:06:18.650 --> 01:06:20.200
He will not shoot.

01:06:45.100 --> 01:06:46.900
best caballero in all Mexico.

01:06:47.020 --> 01:06:49.140
Gracias, mil gracias, señorita.

01:06:49.360 --> 01:06:50.540
And now we finish the breakfast.

01:06:54.780 --> 01:06:54.920
Good.

01:06:55.120 --> 01:06:55.680
And all the breakfast.

01:06:56.070 --> 01:06:56.430
Muy bien.

01:06:57.870 --> 01:06:58.830
Oh, excuse me, señor.

